<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TheUgly — briizOS Canvases v0.1 — stage-pass execution + triage</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cochin,Georgia:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Roboto+Mono&family=Roboto:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #050505;
            --accent-cyan: #26c6da;
            --accent-orange: #ff5722;
            --accent-good: #f4d35e;
            --accent-bad:  #ef4444;
            --text-main: #e0e0e0;
            --text-dim: #8080a0;
            --border-color: #333;
            --header-h: 160px;
            --header-pad: 40px;
            --magic-offset: 200px;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

        .outer-shell {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            min-height: 92vh;
            border: 12px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            min-height: var(--header-h);
            padding: 22px var(--header-pad) 18px var(--header-pad);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0a0a2a, transparent);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            flex-shrink: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header-ascii {
            font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.42rem;
            line-height: 1.05;
            white-space: pre;
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
            letter-spacing: 0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.35);
        }

        .header-ascii .accent { color: var(--accent-cyan); }

        .header-title {
            font-family: 'Cochin', 'Georgia', serif;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #d0d0e0;
            margin: 4px 0 2px 0;
        }

        .header-subtitle {
            font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        }

        .header-summary {
            font-family: 'Cochin', 'Georgia', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            max-width: 820px;
            color: #c7c7d4;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0 auto 8px auto;
        }

        .header-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .header-meta .count-good  { color: var(--accent-good); }
        .header-meta .count-bad   { color: var(--accent-bad); }

        .header-icon {
            position: absolute;
            right: 36px;
            top: 32px;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-orange);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--accent-orange));
        }

        .main-grid {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .column {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
