        <div class="header-title">briizOS Canvases v0.1 — stage-pass execution + triage</div>
        <div class="header-subtitle">Stage-pass dry run: plan, ship, trip, defer v0.2  ·  2026-04-09T20:00:00-07:00  →  2026-04-11T20:00:00-07:00  ·  (48h)</div>
        <p class="header-summary">First real run of the stage-pass discipline, applied to adding a Canvases feature to briizOS.local. Full five-stage arc (UNDERSTANDING-1 through PLAN CHECK-5) produced five planning docs in cowork/10_April_1/, Stage 5 shipped 11 created or modified files with a clean esbuild bundle, and a post-ship triage pass caught a context-menu z-index bug and landed a two-line CSS fix. Alongside the wins, a user-facing edit path for Canvases was completely missed at plan time, a ControlBar overflow wrapper went unprobed, and the scope for v0.2 got large enough to split off into a fresh session rather than tack on.</p>
