                <div class="item-group" id="b1"><div class="hanging-bar"></div><span class="title">No user-facing edit function — canvases are created and inaccessible</span><span class="sub-text">Wired loadCanvas/saveCanvas tools for the onboard AI and added a Save button on LiveCanvas that fires when onSave is passed, but never built a human-facing editor. The user&#x27;s words: &#x27;from my eyevantage, there is no edit function attached to canvases: theyre made and inaccessible&#x27;. This is the headline miss of the session — the entire feature is half-built without it.

