- [ ] Delete the stale &#x27;blue line drawing&#x27; test artifact from {appData}/briizOS/canvas/ if it keeps cluttering the list</span><div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">misdiagnosis</span><span class="tag">evidence</span></div><ul class="nested-list"><li class="nested-item"><details class="ref-details"><summary class="ref-summary"><span class="ref-kind chat">chat</span><span class="code">chat — user</span></summary><pre class="ref-snippet">I did not name it that- - its an artifact that surprisingly is stil there from a test from months ago</pre></details></li></ul></div><div class="item-group" id="b4"><div class="hanging-bar"></div><span class="title">Missed the ControlBar overflow-hidden wrapper at plan time</span><span class="sub-text">PLAN-1 and PLAN-2 both settled on mounting the CanvasesPopover inside the ControlBar for positional anchoring, but neither pass probed whether the ControlBar&#x27;s containing element clipped overflow. It did, and the popover was invisible until the user fixed it by upping the parent z-index themselves. A Stage-1 UX probe of the host container would have caught this.

